          "line_number": 42,
          "new_lines": ["foo"],
          "deletions": [43]  // ❌ This is invalid. "deletions" must not be inside an insertion.
      }
  ]
...
```

### Always double-check that

* "deletions" is not inside any "insertions" object.
* The structure exactly matches the example.
